    "Represent the broad plugin, MCP, app, and skill ecosystem as governed capability families.",
    "Do not activate every plugin live in one session.",
    "Prefer registry, preflight, and local documentation updates before credentialed actions.",
    "Route each task to the smallest useful capability set.",
    "Keep secrets, personal data, and remote writes behind explicit gates."
